# Repository-wide environment. Copy to .env.
#
# Each project reads its own file and only its own file. There is no layering:
# a value set here does not reach tutor-api, so it has to be copied into the
# project that needs it.
#
#   tutor-api/.env    database connection and roles — see its .env.example
#   tutor-core/.env   none; the domain package takes no configuration
#   app/.env          frontend (DEC-0008), once that tree exists
#
# Nothing reads this file yet, so it is comments only.
#
# Pinned runtime versions are deliberately NOT here. The Postgres image, the
# model weights SHA and the Ollama version live in config/runtime.toml,
# committed, because a replayed turn has to reproduce against the same
# versions it was recorded on (DEC-0007, rule 7). An environment variable
# would let those drift per machine, and a drifted pin is a silent replay
# failure rather than a loud one.
#
# Values that would belong here once something reads them:
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434
# TESTCONTAINERS_RYUK_DISABLED=true
